    <sys:String x:Key="Bo3Lang_Settings_Sec_HowItWorks">How does this fix work?</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Bo3Lang_Settings_HowItWorks_Text">On PC, Black Ops III requires each custom map to have fastfile zone files (*.ff) matching your game's language (e.g. fr_*.ff for French, ge_*.ff for German). If map creators only package en_*.ff files, non-English game clients crash immediately when loading the map. This tool creates an exact copy of the en_ files renamed to your language, resolving the issue instantly.</sys:String>
